WEBVTT

00:03.920 --> 00:05.290
<b>It smells a bit musty.</b>

00:05.380 --> 00:07.880
<b>It's probably the sea breeze.</b>

00:09.000 --> 00:10.510
<b>We're almost at the ocean.</b>

00:14.640 --> 00:15.720
<b>The ocean…</b>

00:18.390 --> 00:20.180
<b>I'm so excited to see the ocean.</b>

00:20.270 --> 00:22.890
<b>Is this your first time
seeing the ocean, Urushi?</b>

00:24.100 --> 00:26.400
<b>Let's head to the beach later.</b>

00:27.730 --> 00:28.770
<b>I can't wait.</b>

00:29.070 --> 00:30.440
<b>Are you excited too, Fran?</b>

00:30.860 --> 00:32.820
<b>I've never been to a beach.</b>

00:33.320 --> 00:34.360
<b>I see.</b>

00:34.700 --> 00:37.320
<b>You've been on a ship as a slave,</b>

00:37.410 --> 00:39.790
<b>but you've never played by the sea?</b>

00:40.660 --> 00:42.620
<b>That won't do.</b>

00:42.700 --> 00:46.380
<b>We have to make
some great beach memories for Fran.</b>

01:05.420 --> 01:07.790
<b>Reincarnated as a Sword Season 2</b>

02:22.510 --> 02:25.220
<b>Teacher, where's the beach?</b>

02:25.520 --> 02:27.560
<b>Let's find an inn first.</b>

02:29.420 --> 02:33.420
<b>Episode 6:
The First Beach They See Is Salty</b>

02:29.560 --> 02:31.360
<b>Since we're finally in town,</b>

02:31.440 --> 02:33.400
<b>you want to sleep in a soft bed, right?</b>

02:34.150 --> 02:36.150
<b>Of course.</b>

02:36.240 --> 02:38.360
<b>Where did you learn to talk like that?</b>

02:38.740 --> 02:40.490
<b>I'm sorry, little girl.</b>

02:41.570 --> 02:43.160
<b>That was already the fifth one.</b>

02:45.660 --> 02:48.580
<b>Are the inns in Dars that popular?</b>

02:49.000 --> 02:51.880
<b>Well, let's head
to the Adventurer's Guild first.</b>

02:53.340 --> 02:57.050
<b>The receptionist might be able
to recommend a good inn.</b>

02:57.840 --> 03:00.380
<b>I can't believe you're actually a D-rank.</b>

03:01.090 --> 03:03.550
<b>A genuine D-rank.</b>

03:03.640 --> 03:06.350
<b>Receptionist…</b>

03:09.600 --> 03:11.270
<b>I'm sorry for doubting you.</b>

03:11.770 --> 03:12.900
<b>It's fine.</b>

03:13.310 --> 03:14.310
<b>I'm used to it.</b>

03:15.110 --> 03:16.110
<b>I see.</b>

03:16.650 --> 03:17.900
<b>So what can I do for you?</b>

03:19.610 --> 03:22.740
<b>Let's sell the materials
we gathered on the way.</b>

03:25.780 --> 03:27.330
<b>I'd like to sell these.</b>

03:27.410 --> 03:29.580
<b>And I need an inn recommendation.</b>

03:30.710 --> 03:32.210
<b>An inn?</b>

03:32.290 --> 03:34.460
<b>It might be a bit hard to get one now.</b>

03:34.840 --> 03:35.790
<b>Why?</b>

03:36.130 --> 03:38.710
<b>The March Moon Festival is coming up.</b>

03:39.210 --> 03:40.630
<b>Moon Festival?</b>

03:41.090 --> 03:45.260
<b>The day when all seven moons
in the sky become full?</b>

03:45.350 --> 03:46.390
<b>Exactly.</b>

03:46.850 --> 03:49.180
<b>The Moon Festival
happens four times a year.</b>

03:49.270 --> 03:53.230
<b>A huge festival is held in Bulbola,
the great merchant city of the south.</b>

03:53.310 --> 03:54.400
<b>Bulbola?</b>

03:54.860 --> 03:57.270
<b>That's the town we're heading to next.</b>

03:58.690 --> 04:01.570
<b>At this time of year,
everyone planning to sail to Bulbola</b>

04:01.650 --> 04:03.160
<b>has all gathered in Dars.</b>

04:03.450 --> 04:05.280
<b>That's why all the inns are full.</b>

04:05.660 --> 04:07.780
<b>I see.</b>

04:08.290 --> 04:10.950
<b>I can recommend a few places,</b>

04:11.040 --> 04:12.960
<b>but they probably won't have
any rooms available.</b>

04:13.040 --> 04:14.290
<b>If you really can't get one,</b>

04:14.370 --> 04:17.170
<b>you can sleep on the floor
in the corner of the guild's tavern.</b>

04:17.250 --> 04:21.840
<b>I won't let my Fran do such a thing!</b>

04:25.390 --> 04:27.300
<b>There's no place to stay.</b>

04:27.390 --> 04:29.850
<b>This is bad. What should we do?</b>

04:30.810 --> 04:34.060
<b>Teacher, I'm fine with sleeping
on the guild's floor.</b>

04:34.140 --> 04:35.060
<b>What?</b>

04:35.150 --> 04:36.770
<b>But first, let's go to the beach.</b>

04:39.230 --> 04:42.280
<b>The ocean…</b>

04:42.360 --> 04:45.860
<b>Okay. Let's go before it gets dark.</b>

05:06.180 --> 05:08.890
<b>Teacher, the ocean is harsh.</b>

05:09.680 --> 05:12.600
<b>The water is salty because of the salt.</b>

05:15.850 --> 05:17.190
<b>I feel like</b>

05:17.690 --> 05:19.480
<b>it's different from what I imagined.</b>

05:20.440 --> 05:21.280
<b>Well,</b>

05:21.360 --> 05:24.110
<b>there's more to the beach
than just playing in the water.</b>

05:24.190 --> 05:25.030
<b>Look!</b>

05:25.110 --> 05:26.820
<b>When you think of the beach,
you think of curry!</b>

05:26.910 --> 05:28.570
<b>And fried monster meat!</b>

05:31.660 --> 05:33.540
<b>Curry is the best.</b>

05:34.830 --> 05:36.710
<b>All right. How about some fishing?</b>

05:38.460 --> 05:39.290
<b>You've got a bite, Fran.</b>

05:39.380 --> 05:40.460
<b>Roger.</b>

05:42.050 --> 05:44.210
<b>The rod is like an extension of your arm.</b>

05:45.470 --> 05:46.510
<b>A crab!</b>

05:46.590 --> 05:48.260
<b>Nice, Urushi!</b>

05:52.010 --> 05:54.470
<b>Go play in the sand until it's ready.</b>

05:54.560 --> 05:55.850
<b>Okay.</b>

05:56.230 --> 05:58.060
<b>Town of Alessa.</b>

05:58.150 --> 06:00.730
<b>I didn't know she was so artistic.</b>

06:01.150 --> 06:02.980
<b>Sand bath.</b>

06:04.070 --> 06:04.940
<b>How old-school.</b>

06:05.900 --> 06:08.160
<b>So? Did you have fun at the beach?</b>

06:09.620 --> 06:10.660
<b>I see.</b>

06:12.080 --> 06:13.200
<b>That's good.</b>

06:16.660 --> 06:17.830
<b>Water Creator.</b>

06:23.380 --> 06:25.170
<b>The stickiness is all washed off.</b>

06:25.300 --> 06:26.340
<b>All right.</b>

06:26.420 --> 06:28.430
<b>Once you've changed,
even a cheap inn will do.</b>

06:28.510 --> 06:29.970
<b>Let's find a place to stay.</b>

06:30.390 --> 06:31.220
<b>Okay.</b>

06:32.970 --> 06:34.010
<b>They're all full.</b>

06:35.180 --> 06:36.390
<b>I'm sleepy.</b>

06:37.600 --> 06:40.020
<b>Let's check the harbor area too.</b>

06:42.690 --> 06:45.980
<b>It's easier said than done.
There don't seem to be any inns.</b>

06:46.400 --> 06:48.740
<b>We can just sleep on the guild floor.</b>

06:51.370 --> 06:52.370
<b>Fran.</b>

06:58.540 --> 07:01.670
<b>I thought I smelled
the scent of dried vomit.</b>

07:01.750 --> 07:03.340
<b>I was right.</b>

07:03.750 --> 07:07.170
<b>Well, isn't that the little girl
from Black Cat Tribe?</b>

07:08.220 --> 07:09.590
<b>Are you lost?</b>

07:10.220 --> 07:11.970
<b>I'll show you the way.</b>

07:12.340 --> 07:13.930
<b>Blue Cat Tribe…</b>

07:14.010 --> 07:17.180
<b>Do they have pickpocketing,
assassination, and interrogation skills?</b>

07:17.270 --> 07:19.270
<b>They're not decent people at all.</b>

07:19.850 --> 07:21.810
<b>I can tell they're trash at a glance.</b>

07:21.900 --> 07:24.110
<b>Don't talk. You stink.</b>

07:24.190 --> 07:26.820
<b>I'll cut off your tongue and legs.</b>

07:26.900 --> 07:29.950
<b>That way,
buyers will be happy to pay for it too.</b>

07:30.030 --> 07:32.070
<b>Wind Magic, Silence.</b>

07:36.580 --> 07:37.490
<b>My voice…</b>

07:39.120 --> 07:40.160
<b>What's going on?</b>

07:40.710 --> 07:42.710
<b>Earth Magic, Stone Wall.</b>

07:43.460 --> 07:46.460
<b>Now your screams won't be heard.</b>

07:47.050 --> 07:48.880
<b>And no one can see in from outside.</b>

07:49.590 --> 07:52.800
<b>I never go easy on Blue Cat Tribe.</b>

07:53.800 --> 07:56.220
<b>I told you.
Black Cats aren't allowed to talk!</b>

07:56.310 --> 07:58.020
<b>Shut your mouth!</b>

08:08.030 --> 08:08.900
<b>Wait.</b>

08:09.190 --> 08:10.820
<b>The one over there is already dead.</b>

08:10.900 --> 08:13.070
<b>How can this be?</b>

08:13.240 --> 08:14.700
<b>Answer my questions.</b>

08:14.780 --> 08:16.830
<b>Are you underground slave traders?</b>

08:16.910 --> 08:17.910
<b>Where is your base?</b>

08:17.990 --> 08:20.040
<b>How many child slaves do you have now?</b>

08:21.500 --> 08:23.920
<b>Even if I knew,
why would I tell a Black Cat such a--</b>

08:26.250 --> 08:27.500
<b>Greater Heal.</b>

08:28.960 --> 08:31.800
<b>Even if you're healed,
you'll still feel excruciating pain.</b>

08:31.880 --> 08:32.720
<b>Wait!</b>

08:33.760 --> 08:35.800
<b>I'll keep going until you answer me.</b>

08:38.890 --> 08:41.060
<b>- I'm so tired.
- Fran never goes easy on Blue Cats.</b>

08:41.140 --> 08:43.810
<b>- Let's go drink!
- Fran never goes easy on Blue Cats.</b>

08:44.980 --> 08:46.690
<b>Greater Heal.</b>

08:48.440 --> 08:49.530
<b>You Black Cat!</b>

08:49.610 --> 08:51.440
<b>Why would you do something so cruel?</b>

08:52.780 --> 08:55.160
<b>I cut off your legs and tongue,
and then healed them.</b>

08:55.450 --> 08:56.780
<b>Where should I cut next?</b>

08:57.490 --> 09:01.790
<b>Since most Black Cats
are targeted by Blue Cat Tribe,</b>

09:02.290 --> 09:07.500
<b>Fran believes that eliminating Blue Cats
is the way to protect Black Cats.</b>

09:08.290 --> 09:10.460
<b>That's why she won't show any mercy.</b>

09:12.590 --> 09:13.590
<b>Sanity.</b>

09:17.510 --> 09:19.100
<b>I won't let you faint either.</b>

09:19.180 --> 09:21.180
<b>I'll keep going until you answer me.</b>

09:21.770 --> 09:23.020
<b>I get it!</b>

09:23.310 --> 09:24.390
<b>I'll talk!</b>

09:24.480 --> 09:26.600
<b>I'll tell you everything!</b>

09:32.400 --> 09:33.490
<b>Is that the place?</b>

09:34.440 --> 09:35.360
<b>Let's go.</b>

09:46.330 --> 09:48.460
<b>Sense Presence. Heat Sensing.</b>

09:49.380 --> 09:51.210
<b>They seem to be gathered downstairs.</b>

09:51.500 --> 09:54.670
<b>It'll be bad if something happens
to the kidnapped children.</b>

09:54.760 --> 09:56.010
<b>Let's attack from above.</b>

09:56.760 --> 09:58.640
<b>It's time for some spring cleaning.</b>

10:08.980 --> 10:10.900
<b>No, we're not, you idiot.</b>

10:12.190 --> 10:13.690
<b>Wait. That hurts.</b>

10:20.280 --> 10:21.990
<b>My ears…</b>

10:44.810 --> 10:46.680
<b>They're unexpectedly high-quality goods.</b>

10:46.770 --> 10:50.100
<b>Those twins look like
they'll fetch a high price.</b>

10:50.190 --> 10:52.440
<b>Does that mean I'm also…</b>

11:01.490 --> 11:03.990
<b>Second floor and above, suppressed.</b>

11:05.160 --> 11:06.580
<b>Let's see.</b>

11:06.660 --> 11:09.500
<b>Passing through the Sea Nation of Seedrun,</b>

11:09.580 --> 11:12.380
<b>those slaves are being sent
to the Raydoss Kingdom?</b>

11:12.460 --> 11:13.630
<b>Raydoss…</b>

11:14.040 --> 11:17.970
<b>And these guys from Seedrun,
Suarez and Julius,</b>

11:18.050 --> 11:20.760
<b>are definitely involved.</b>

11:27.890 --> 11:28.980
<b>Hey, you.</b>

11:29.060 --> 11:31.020
<b>Your hands are hanging out.</b>

11:31.100 --> 11:32.770
<b>Handle them with care.</b>

11:32.860 --> 11:35.320
<b>It's bad if they see your face.</b>

11:35.400 --> 11:38.320
<b>You're the only kid who would attack them.</b>

11:38.400 --> 11:40.900
<b>It'll be trouble if you're recognized.</b>

11:40.990 --> 11:43.160
<b>Clear the other rooms first.</b>

11:43.240 --> 11:44.830
<b>Next are those five.</b>

11:44.910 --> 11:48.160
<b>Then the basement last.
Let's go in that order.</b>

11:48.250 --> 11:49.160
<b>Okay.</b>

12:09.560 --> 12:11.440
<b>Next are those five.</b>

12:11.940 --> 12:13.480
<b>If I use Silence now,</b>

12:13.560 --> 12:15.270
<b>those three in the basement
will be on guard.</b>

12:15.360 --> 12:16.900
<b>The children would be in danger.</b>

12:17.320 --> 12:18.690
<b>Urushi, I'm counting on you.</b>

12:20.900 --> 12:23.410
<b>- Dark Magic, Black Curtain.
- What's going on?</b>

12:23.490 --> 12:24.700
<b>- Once their vision is gone…
- Hey, my eyes…</b>

12:24.780 --> 12:26.410
<b>- Once their vision is gone…
- Light a lamp! Hurry!</b>

12:27.370 --> 12:29.240
<b>Cut them down quickly.</b>

12:31.160 --> 12:33.170
<b>Use Air Blades for the rest.</b>

12:33.920 --> 12:35.920
<b>Good. Into Dimensional Storage.</b>

12:36.000 --> 12:38.130
<b>First floor suppressed.</b>

12:39.050 --> 12:40.550
<b>Next is the basement.</b>

12:41.630 --> 12:44.930
<b>Hey, what are you muttering about?</b>

12:45.800 --> 12:48.890
<b>How could you do such cruel things
to such young children?</b>

12:49.180 --> 12:51.430
<b>- Kidnapping and selling children…
- Spend 3 points to summon!</b>

12:51.520 --> 12:53.270
<b>- You're worse than scum!
- Use this effect to negate the summon!</b>

12:53.350 --> 12:54.730
<b>- What did you say, you brat?
- This is too much!</b>

12:54.810 --> 12:56.310
<b>- You're the scum here!
- This is too much!</b>

12:56.690 --> 12:58.070
<b>There are seven children.</b>

12:58.150 --> 12:59.860
<b>All right. Let's do this.</b>

13:01.110 --> 13:03.280
<b>I don't care if you're merchandise or not.</b>

13:03.360 --> 13:06.450
<b>I'll gouge out your eyes and tongue!</b>

13:13.500 --> 13:14.410
<b>Who are you?</b>

13:14.830 --> 13:16.380
<b>An ally of justice.</b>

13:16.880 --> 13:18.000
<b>Stay back.</b>

13:21.050 --> 13:22.420
<b>Using a sword to break the bars…</b>

13:22.510 --> 13:23.630
<b>I'm here to save you.</b>

13:23.720 --> 13:24.720
<b>Hurry and escape.</b>

13:26.390 --> 13:28.300
<b>Are you an assassin?</b>

13:30.680 --> 13:31.520
<b>No.</b>

13:31.600 --> 13:34.180
<b>Fran, a D-rank adventurer.</b>

13:34.770 --> 13:37.400
<b>A girl about my age?</b>

13:38.190 --> 13:42.360
<b>Judging by their clothes,
are they nobles or something?</b>

13:42.650 --> 13:44.610
<b>It's better not to let your guard down.</b>

13:44.700 --> 13:48.410
<b>There are about 20 underground
slave traders in this building.</b>

13:48.490 --> 13:49.950
<b>A total of 22.</b>

13:51.160 --> 13:52.620
<b>I've already killed them all.</b>

13:53.870 --> 13:55.080
<b>Along with Urushi.</b>

13:59.250 --> 14:01.880
<b>Anyway, it stinks in here. Let's go.</b>

14:01.960 --> 14:02.960
<b>Please wait.</b>

14:03.760 --> 14:05.920
<b>There's a contract spell on their collars.</b>

14:06.760 --> 14:09.390
<b>If they run away now,
the spell will activate.</b>

14:10.350 --> 14:11.930
<b>If that's the case, it's fine.</b>

14:20.690 --> 14:22.020
<b>It's fine now.</b>

14:24.150 --> 14:25.400
<b>Are you hurt?</b>

14:26.900 --> 14:28.110
<b>Mid-Tier Healing.</b>

14:29.110 --> 14:30.700
<b>You can even use healing magic.</b>

14:31.700 --> 14:32.990
<b>Let's get out of here.</b>

14:34.910 --> 14:36.210
<b>Someone is coming.</b>

14:37.960 --> 14:40.170
<b>Teacher, is it one of their comrades?</b>

14:40.460 --> 14:41.630
<b>I'm not sure,</b>

14:41.710 --> 14:43.590
<b>but he's using a skill
to hide his presence.</b>

14:43.670 --> 14:45.380
<b>He's definitely an expert.</b>

14:46.720 --> 14:48.260
<b>Everyone, wait here.</b>

14:49.050 --> 14:50.010
<b>Ms. Fran!</b>

14:51.550 --> 14:53.680
<b>Fran, don't kill him if you can help it.</b>

14:53.760 --> 14:57.180
<b>Since he's an expert, he might be
an executive of this organization.</b>

14:57.270 --> 14:59.060
<b>I want to get some information.</b>

14:59.770 --> 15:00.730
<b>Understood.</b>

15:12.870 --> 15:13.830
<b>A shield?</b>

15:24.130 --> 15:26.760
<b>His sword parrying technique is superb.</b>

15:27.170 --> 15:28.260
<b>Appraisal.</b>

15:28.940 --> 15:37.450
<b>Title: Oathbreaker, Guardian
Equipment: High-Quality Dark Mithril Sword
Blackened Mithril Shield
Blackened Mithril Full-Body Armor，Jet-Black Cloak
Magic Resistance Bracelet，Ring of Bonds</b>

15:30.360 --> 15:37.450
<b>Skills: Dark Resistance 6, Assassination 4, Intimidation 5, Stealth 3, Appraisal Interference 6,
Presence Concealment 3, Sword Saint Skills 1, Sword Skills 10, Sword Saint Techniques 2
Swordsmanship 10, Court Etiquette 3, Shield Skills 7, Shield Techniques 8, Interrogation 4,
Poison Resistance 4,Poison Magic 3, Storm Resistance 6, Restraint 5
Paralysis Resistance 4, Dark Magic 5, Ki Manipulation
Special Skill: Dark Aura</b>

15:30.930 --> 15:32.470
<b>His skills are also quite…</b>

15:32.550 --> 15:34.640
<b>Fran, this is a formidable enemy.</b>

15:33.030 --> 15:37.450
<b>Life: 169,  Magic: 288
Strength: 236, Agility: 127</b>

15:34.720 --> 15:35.560
<b>It'll be hard</b>

15:35.620 --> 15:37.450
<b>Salut Orland</b>

15:35.620 --> 15:37.450
<b>Age: 55, Race: Human
Job: Dark Knight</b>

15:35.640 --> 15:37.560
<b>to hold back from killing him.</b>

15:37.640 --> 15:39.430
<b>Then I'll just stun him.</b>

15:40.770 --> 15:41.810
<b>Take this.</b>

15:42.190 --> 15:44.820
<b>Thunder Magic, Paralyzing Electric Blast!</b>

15:49.490 --> 15:50.700
<b>Elemental Sword.</b>

15:51.990 --> 15:52.990
<b>Thunder.</b>

15:54.740 --> 15:56.200
<b>I won't lose.</b>

15:57.790 --> 16:00.040
<b>Dark Magic: Dark Arrow!</b>

16:04.040 --> 16:05.670
<b>Darkness Nullification.</b>

16:06.090 --> 16:07.800
<b>That's a Greater Demon's skill.</b>

16:28.610 --> 16:29.480
<b>Prepare yourself.</b>

16:32.570 --> 16:33.450
<b>Wait!</b>

16:34.450 --> 16:35.450
<b>What is it?</b>

16:39.620 --> 16:41.870
<b>Prince Flut! Princess Satya!</b>

16:41.960 --> 16:43.500
<b>You're safe!</b>

16:45.460 --> 16:47.340
<b>A prince and princess?</b>

16:50.090 --> 16:52.050
<b>To think she took down
so many enemies alone</b>

16:52.130 --> 16:54.510
<b>and even rescued the prince and princess.</b>

16:54.890 --> 16:57.050
<b>Lady Fran, you have my gratitude.</b>

16:58.100 --> 17:00.520
<b>I almost cut off your limbs too.</b>

17:00.600 --> 17:01.430
<b>So let's call it even.</b>

17:01.520 --> 17:03.390
<b>My limbs?</b>

17:03.480 --> 17:05.100
<b>This is Salut.</b>

17:05.190 --> 17:08.400
<b>He has been our guardian knight
since we were small.</b>

17:09.110 --> 17:10.780
<b>Prince, Princess.</b>

17:10.860 --> 17:12.490
<b>I have failed in my duties.</b>

17:12.950 --> 17:14.450
<b>I'm deeply sorry.</b>

17:14.530 --> 17:16.320
<b>There's no need to apologize, Salut.</b>

17:16.410 --> 17:19.950
<b>Yes. It was our fault for ditching you.</b>

17:20.040 --> 17:20.910
<b>We're sorry.</b>

17:21.250 --> 17:22.910
<b>Stare…</b>

17:23.250 --> 17:25.460
<b>Forgive me. I haven't introduced myself.</b>

17:25.540 --> 17:27.330
<b>I'm Flut Phyllius.</b>

17:27.670 --> 17:29.710
<b>The prince of the Kingdom of Phyllius.</b>

17:29.800 --> 17:31.170
<b>And I'm Satya Phyllius.</b>

17:31.340 --> 17:32.920
<b>The princess of the same kingdom.</b>

17:33.130 --> 17:35.880
<b>They're not just nobles. They're royalty.</b>

17:36.300 --> 17:38.260
<b>Fran, don't be rude.</b>

17:38.680 --> 17:39.810
<b>Royalty…</b>

17:40.180 --> 17:42.470
<b>Indeed. These two are twins.</b>

17:42.560 --> 17:47.520
<b>They are the sixth and seventh
in line to the Phyllius throne.</b>

17:47.980 --> 17:49.610
<b>Phyllius?</b>

17:49.690 --> 17:50.650
<b>Never heard of it.</b>

17:50.730 --> 17:51.940
<b>Hey!</b>

17:52.190 --> 17:53.820
<b>Fran, that's way too blunt.</b>

17:54.280 --> 17:55.320
<b>I see.</b>

17:55.700 --> 17:58.490
<b>It's a small country north of Dars.</b>

17:58.570 --> 18:00.580
<b>A neighbor to the Kingdom of Granzell.</b>

18:00.660 --> 18:02.580
<b>I'd be honored if you'd remember it.</b>

18:03.540 --> 18:05.540
<b>I'll try my best.</b>

18:05.620 --> 18:07.170
<b>Hey…</b>

18:07.250 --> 18:10.920
<b>But why were a prince and a princess
captured by slave traders?</b>

18:11.210 --> 18:13.260
<b>How did you get caught?</b>

18:13.340 --> 18:18.090
<b>We were curious about the lively streets
during the Moon Festival.</b>

18:18.300 --> 18:19.510
<b>To catch a glimpse of the festivities,</b>

18:19.600 --> 18:21.760
<b>we hid from Salut, who was watching us,</b>

18:21.850 --> 18:23.310
<b>and sneaked into the city.</b>

18:23.390 --> 18:25.060
<b>I see.</b>

18:25.430 --> 18:28.900
<b>And that's when the Blue Cats found you.</b>

18:30.980 --> 18:32.770
<b>Anyway, let's get out of here.</b>

18:33.110 --> 18:34.030
<b>You're right.</b>

18:34.570 --> 18:37.360
<b>The others might come back.</b>

18:38.530 --> 18:41.780
<b>Let's take shelter at the inn
where we're staying.</b>

18:43.910 --> 18:45.410
<b>Wait.</b>

18:45.500 --> 18:47.750
<b>Did you book this whole place?</b>

18:48.040 --> 18:49.750
<b>Amazing.</b>

18:50.170 --> 18:51.920
<b>- Royalty…
- It's so beautiful.</b>

18:52.000 --> 18:53.710
<b>- is incredible!
- I've never been to a place like this.</b>

18:55.130 --> 18:57.130
<b>Why is it so noisy?</b>

18:57.760 --> 18:59.840
<b>Sellid, we're back.</b>

18:59.930 --> 19:02.470
<b>Your Highness, I was worried sick.</b>

19:03.470 --> 19:07.560
<b>Please don't tell Sellid we were captured.</b>

19:07.640 --> 19:09.730
<b>Otherwise, Salut will be reprimanded.</b>

19:09.810 --> 19:10.650
<b>Understood.</b>

19:10.850 --> 19:14.150
<b>So what exactly happened?</b>

19:14.270 --> 19:16.570
<b>We got separated from Salut.</b>

19:16.650 --> 19:18.070
<b>While we were lost,</b>

19:18.150 --> 19:20.780
<b>they offered to guide us back.</b>

19:21.370 --> 19:22.950
<b>I see.</b>

19:23.490 --> 19:27.040
<b>Then that filthy beastman over there is…</b>

19:27.410 --> 19:30.120
<b>Teacher, am I filthy?</b>

19:30.210 --> 19:33.000
<b>Not at all, Fran.</b>

19:33.420 --> 19:34.800
<b>Watch your tongue!</b>

19:35.690 --> 19:38.360
<b>Filthy</b>

19:35.960 --> 19:37.970
<b>This is Fran, an adventurer.</b>

19:38.050 --> 19:40.510
<b>She's our benefactor who escorted us here.</b>

19:41.300 --> 19:46.680
<b>We're welcoming Ms. Fran and the children
as our personal guests.</b>

19:47.060 --> 19:47.890
<b>What?</b>

19:47.980 --> 19:50.100
<b>I can't allow such selfishness.</b>

19:50.190 --> 19:52.860
<b>Please remember your status.</b>

19:52.940 --> 19:55.690
<b>To let such filthy, lowborn people in…</b>

19:56.190 --> 19:57.690
<b>That's enough.</b>

20:03.530 --> 20:05.740
<b>There are unpleasant people everywhere.</b>

20:06.240 --> 20:07.330
<b>I hate him.</b>

20:07.490 --> 20:08.500
<b>Fran.</b>

20:09.160 --> 20:10.330
<b>If you'll have it,</b>

20:10.410 --> 20:12.330
<b>we'd like to provide rooms
and meals for you.</b>

20:12.420 --> 20:13.250
<b>What do you say?</b>

20:13.830 --> 20:15.460
<b>- Really?
- Is it okay?</b>

20:16.000 --> 20:17.300
<b>You're our savior.</b>

20:17.750 --> 20:19.880
<b>Please let us show our gratitude.</b>

20:20.220 --> 20:22.630
<b>An inn that was impossible to book…</b>

20:22.720 --> 20:24.640
<b>This is a godsend.</b>

20:24.720 --> 20:27.310
<b>I can finally sleep in a fluffy bed.</b>

20:29.390 --> 20:30.600
<b>I'm so sorry.</b>

20:30.680 --> 20:32.980
<b>My attendant, Sellid,
was very rude to you earlier.</b>

20:33.560 --> 20:36.730
<b>He's capable but quite narrow-minded.</b>

20:36.820 --> 20:38.400
<b>It's fine. I'm used to it.</b>

20:38.480 --> 20:39.690
<b>Thank you.</b>

20:40.190 --> 20:42.910
<b>You have a very strong will, Fran.</b>

20:42.990 --> 20:44.450
<b>That's right.</b>

20:49.540 --> 20:50.500
<b>What?</b>

20:51.290 --> 20:56.000
<b>The wild scent lingering
in the back of my nose…</b>

20:56.460 --> 20:58.420
<b>Please enjoy your bath.</b>

21:00.550 --> 21:03.220
<b>Teacher, do I smell?</b>

21:03.300 --> 21:06.720
<b>I'm a sword, so I wouldn't know.</b>

21:11.930 --> 21:14.390
<b>Teacher and I are both sparkling clean.</b>

21:16.270 --> 21:17.730
<b>You want to soak in the hot water?</b>

21:17.810 --> 21:19.230
<b>Then you have to wash up first.</b>

21:20.780 --> 21:23.150
<b>It's so fun taking a bath together.</b>

21:23.240 --> 21:26.410
<b>We should thank the prince and princess.</b>

21:27.700 --> 21:31.200
<b>Those two are nobles,
but they aren't annoying at all.</b>

21:32.200 --> 21:33.160
<b>What about Sellid?</b>

21:33.250 --> 21:34.580
<b>He's a lost cause.</b>

21:36.710 --> 21:37.880
<b>After the bath,</b>

21:37.960 --> 21:42.010
<b>the prince treated Fran
and the rescued children to a meal.</b>

21:42.920 --> 21:45.510
<b>Children who know where they live
will be sent back to their parents.</b>

21:45.590 --> 21:46.800
<b>As for the homeless children,</b>

21:46.890 --> 21:49.760
<b>they'll be taken to Phyllius
to be cared for.</b>

21:50.680 --> 21:52.470
<b>They look the same age as Fran,</b>

21:52.560 --> 21:55.730
<b>yet they already possess
the dignity of royalty.</b>

21:55.810 --> 21:58.150
<b>They're quite reliable.</b>

22:01.110 --> 22:02.780
<b>Is the prey here?</b>

23:34.010 --> 23:40.020
<b>Next Episode</b>

23:34.010 --> 23:40.020
<b>The Sea Monsters Are Too Big</b>
